		(property "Description" "PIC18-Q84 8-bit MCU with CAN FD, 64 MHz, 128 KB flash, 13 KB RAM, 1 KB EEPROM, 12-bit ADCC, 8-bit DAC, PPS, TQFP-44 10x10 mm, 0.8 mm pitch. Pinout per DS40002213C Fig 2-5 / Table 3-2 (44-TQFP column). CANTX/CANRX, I2C, SPI, UART and PWM are PPS-remappable."
